cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Gbg-SEM-TreeSeg"
abstract: >-
  Semantic segmentation of tree canopy and water in large aerial orthophoto
  mosaics over Gothenburg, Sweden, using the AerialFormer architecture
  (Swin Transformer encoder + multi-dilated CNN decoder) on mmsegmentation 0.x.
  Produces the canopy-prior segmentation raster consumed by the Gbg-INST-TreeSeg
  tree-crown instance pipeline.
type: software
authors:
